  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Inclusive and Peaceful Democratic Processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports electoral reform through legislative advocacy for the amendment of section 4.5 of the New Elections Law (NEL) that would mandate political parties to achieve the 30% gender quota. It further promotes women&#x2019;s peace and security during political processes through dialogues at the local level; and increases citizens&#x2019; participation in political governance through civic education.</narrative>
  </description>
